# Prisma computes a SHA-256 checksum over each migration.sql and compares it to
# the value stored in _prisma_migrations. With core.autocrlf=true and no rule
# here, Git rewrites these files to CRLF on checkout, the bytes stop matching,
# and Prisma reports the migration history as drifted — which makes
# `prisma migrate dev` demand a full database reset.
#
# Pinning them to LF keeps the checksum identical on Windows, Linux and CI.
# Do not remove this without running `npm run db:check-migrations`.
prisma/migrations/**/*.sql text eol=lf

# Same reasoning for any other checked-in SQL that tooling hashes or diffs.
*.sql text eol=lf
